# DraftKings Bestball Position Rules

This project is focused on **DraftKings bestball analysis**. Only use the following positions in all code, data models, and UI components:

## Core Positions Only
- **QB** (Quarterback)
- **RB** (Running Back) 
- **WR** (Wide Receiver)
- **TE** (Tight End)

## Excluded Positions
Do NOT use or reference:
- **K** (Kicker) - not used in bestball
- **DST** (Defense/Special Teams) - not used in bestball

## Implementation Guidelines
- Use `CorePosition` type: `'QB' | 'RB' | 'WR' | 'TE'`
- Filter out K and DST from any position arrays or enums
- Update data models to exclude kicker and defense data
- Ensure UI components only show the four core positions
- When creating charts, filters, or analytics, focus only on QB, RB, WR, TE

This rule applies to both frontend and backend code, ensuring consistency across the entire application for bestball analysis.
